## Scope note

These files contain **metadata only**: entity identifiers and aliases,
curated universe membership, and provenance records for filings acquired from
national registers and regulators. The underlying filings and documents
themselves are **not** part of this repository and are **not** covered by
this license — they remain on their issuing authorities' servers under those
authorities' own terms.

The source code of this repository is separately licensed under the MIT
license — see [LICENSE](LICENSE).

## Recorded fixtures under `tests/fixtures/`

The directories below hold recorded HTML/JSON/XBRL responses reproduced
verbatim for regression tests. They are recordings of each authority's own
publicly served output, not original data produced by this project; each
authority's own reuse terms apply to them and the CC BY grant above does
**not** cover them.

- `tests/fixtures/be/` — National Bank of Belgium (NBB) Central Balance Sheet
  Office (CBSO): BE-GAAP annual-account XBRL deposit filings.
- `tests/fixtures/dk/` — Erhvervsstyrelsen (Danish Business Authority), via
  the Virk/ERST distribution service (`distribution.virk.dk` /
  `regnskaber.virk.dk`): DK-GAAP class-B annual-account XBRL filings.
- `tests/fixtures/ee/` — Estonian e-Business Register (Äriregister / RIK,
  `avaandmed.ariregister.rik.ee`): bulk open-data CSV exports of annual
  report elements and metadata.
- `tests/fixtures/eu/` — captures from the "European EDGAR" OAM portals and
  supporting identity registries: Belgium FSMA STORI, Switzerland SIX/EQS
  (DisclosureCH), Germany Bundesanzeiger, Denmark Finanstilsynet OAM
  Publication API, Spain CNMV, Euronext cross-market notices, Finland oam.fi
  (Nasdaq Helsinki), France AMF info-financiere.gouv.fr, UK FCA National
  Storage Mechanism, Italy 1Info (OneInfo), Netherlands AFM, Norway Oslo
  Børs NewsWeb, Sweden Finanscentralen OAM, GLEIF LEI-record API, and
  filings.xbrl.org (XBRL International).
- `tests/fixtures/fi/` — Finnish Patent and Registration Office (PRH):
  dimensional XBRL annual-account filings.
- `tests/fixtures/lu/` — Luxembourg Business Registers (LBR) eCDF: annual
  financial-declaration XML filings.
- `tests/fixtures/sk/` — Slovak RegisterUZ (`registeruz.sk`): positional
  JSON annual-financial-statement API responses.
- `tests/fixtures/uk/` — UK Companies House: bare-iXBRL annual-account
  filings (FRS 102 and FRS 105).

Personal fields (names, addresses and contact details) have been redacted
from the recorded captures.
